@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-10  Find and start a course
' Requirements: PROFILE-01 PROFILE-02 DISC-01 DISC-02 DISC-03 DISC-04 CONTENT-03 CONTENT-06 CONTENT-07
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Student" as U
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
U -> S: Search titles/descriptions; filter topic and difficulty
S --> U: Show published courses open to new learners
opt Clear filters
  U -> S: Clear search and selected filters
  S --> U: Show full available catalog
end
U -> S: Open course details
S --> U: Show outcomes, owner, lessons, prerequisites, completion rules
U -> S: Start selected course
alt Student already started this course
  S --> U: Resume existing participation and original revision
else Course no longer open to new starts
  S --> U: Explain unavailability; do not create participation
else Published course is available
  S --> U: Start current published revision; show lessons
end
note over U,S
Prerequisites and lesson order are advisory.
My learning includes started and completed courses,
including archived courses already started.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-10 | Product behavior
@enduml
